    "updated_at": "2022-08-09T09:05:37Z",
    "body": "Regarding the question of which issues in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/4184#issuecomment-1072536425 should be considered blocking for writing up a spec of https://github.com/whatwg/html/wiki/dialog--initial-focus,-a-proposal#initial-dialog-focus-logic : This is about whether to include a single sentence in the spec proposal there. And we have at least some positive support for including the sentence, from @zcorpan and the two thumbs-uppers. So I think we should call this resolved, and that sentence should be included in the PR.",
